EwmhBaseStruts screen $[monitor.primary] 8 8 32 8

DestroyFunc IconManClick
AddToFunc IconManClick
+ I ThisWindow (Raised, Focused, !Iconic, CurrentPage) Iconify
+ I TestRc (Match) Break
+ I ThisWindow Raise
+ I ThisWindow (Iconic) Iconify
+ I ThisWindow (AcceptsFocus) FlipFocus

Style FvwmPanel !Title, !Borders, !Handles, Sticky, \
                WindowListSkip, NeverFocus

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmPanel: *
*FvwmPanel: Geometry 2560x24+0+0
*FvwmPanel: Colorset 2
*FvwmPanel: Frame 0
*FvwmPanel: Font "xft:SF Compact Display:style=Medium:size=12"
*FvwmPanel: Columns 2560
*FvwmPanel: Rows 24

*FvwmPanel: (72x24, ActiveColorset 3, PressColorset 3, \
             Padding 0 0, Icon orb.png, Title (Side) Start, \
             Action(Mouse 1) Menu rootmenu Root 0+36p 0+12p, \
             Action(Mouse 3) Exec exec $[infostore.runcmd])

*FvwmPanel: (3x24, Padding 0 0, Icon pad.xpm)

*FvwmPanel: (2343x24, Swallow FvwmIconMan 'Module FvwmIconMan')

*FvwmPanel: (3x24, Padding 0 0, Icon pad.xpm)

*FvwmPanel: (64x24, id "FvwmClock", Title "clock")

*FvwmPanel: (3x24, Padding 0 0, Icon pad.xpm)

*FvwmPanel: (24x24, ActiveColorset 3, PressColorset 3, \
             Icon min.xpm, Action(Mouse 1) Pick Iconify)
*FvwmPanel: (24x24, ActiveColorset 3, PressColorset 3, \
             Icon max.xpm, Action(Mouse 1) Pick Maximize)
*FvwmPanel: (24x24, ActiveColorset 3, PressColorset 3, \
             Icon close.xpm, Action(Mouse 1) Pick Close)

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmIconMan: *
*FvwmIconMan: Resolution global
*FvwmIconMan: UseWinList true
*FvwmIconMan: FollowFocus true

*FvwmIconMan: Font "xft:SF Compact Display:style=Medium:size=12"
*FvwmIconMan: ButtonGeometry 192x24
*FvwmIconMan: MaxButtonWidth 2343
*FvwmIconMan: ManagerGeometry 1x1

*FvwmIconMan: DrawIcons always
*FvwmIconMan: ReliefThickness 0
*FvwmIconMan: Format "%t"

*FvwmIconMan: Colorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: PlainColorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: IconColorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: FocusColorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: SelectColorset 3
*FvwmIconMan: IconAndSelectColorset 3
*FvwmIconMan: FocusAndSelectColorset 3

*FvwmIconMan: Sort weighted
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 10 class=firefox
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 15 class=feishin
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 20 class=discord title=*Discord
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 20 class=vesktop title=Discord*
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 25 class=discord
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 25 class=vesktop
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 30 class=steam title=Steam
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 35 class=steam
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 40 class=qBittorrent
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 45 class=org.nicotine_plus.Nicotine
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 55 class=Alacritty
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 65 class=Thunar
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 100 # everything else trailing

*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 0 N sendcommand Nop
*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 1 A sendcommand IconManClick

PipeRead 'echo "SendToModule FvwmButtons ChangeButton \
FvwmClock Title \"`date +%I:%M`\""'

Schedule Periodic 10000 PipeRead 'echo "SendToModule \
FvwmButtons ChangeButton FvwmClock Title \"`date +%I:%M`\""'

DestroyFunc StartFunction
AddToFunc   StartFunction
+ I Module FvwmButtons FvwmPanel
